    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Melon Clicker, a relaxing game where you collect points by simply clicking on a </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >melon. Ideal for short breaks or unwinding after a long day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Gameplay:</strong>\u00a0Click on the melon to accumulate points\u2014perfect for quick sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Experience:</strong>\u00a0Enjoy a stress-free game without complex mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Future Updates:</strong>\u00a0Look forward to upcoming features like upgrades, challenges, and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual gamer or just looking to relax for a few minutes, Melon Clicker offers a straightforward and entertaining experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to start clicking?</strong>\u00a0Jump in now and see how many points you can gather!</p>",
